<title>UK: EBRD will hold 1998 annual meeting in Ukraine.</title>
<headline>EBRD will hold 1998 annual meeting in Ukraine.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) will hold its 1998 annual meeting in Kiev.</p>
<p>&quot;The EBRD's decision to hold the 1998 governors' meeting in Kiev is a recognition by member countries of the real growth potential of Ukraine. The event will, no doubt, impart further momentum to transition towards privatisation and the market economy,&quot; EBRD secretary general Antonio Maria Costa said.</p>
<p>The meeting this year was in Bulgaria. The 1997 annual meeting will be in London April 12-15.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770</p>
</text>
